WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:31.430 --> 01:40.120
[Song of the Moon]

01:40.120 --> 01:42.990
[Episode 30]

01:43.180 --> 01:44.100
We've been in here too long.

01:44.500 --> 01:46.020
We have to find the crack as soon as possible.

01:46.460 --> 01:47.060
I'm afraid

01:47.500 --> 01:48.539
we won't be able to get out later.

01:49.860 --> 01:51.460
I'm affected by Yin-yang Power.

01:51.460 --> 01:52.780
I can't use the water spirit.

01:53.930 --> 01:54.620
Luo Ge.

01:55.300 --> 01:55.979
I can only count on you.

01:56.900 --> 01:57.979
If the Immortal does something,

01:58.220 --> 01:59.380
the boundary can be barely opened

01:59.539 --> 02:00.740
for a moment.

02:21.820 --> 02:22.380
They're coming.

02:23.020 --> 02:23.820
I'll go stop them first.

02:24.260 --> 02:24.740
Shiwei.

02:33.140 --> 02:34.460
Luo Ge, what should we do?

02:40.780 --> 02:41.220
He Na.

02:41.780 --> 02:42.220
You go first.

02:42.340 --> 02:42.860
Hurry.

02:43.020 --> 02:43.420
Okay.

02:45.420 --> 02:45.810
Luo Ge.

02:46.100 --> 02:46.620
Come on out.

02:53.460 --> 02:54.100
What are you doing?

02:55.220 --> 02:56.530
Luo Ge, what do you mean?

02:56.620 --> 02:57.020
He Na.

02:58.060 --> 02:58.940
Take care of Liu Shao for me.

02:59.620 --> 03:00.140
Luo Ge.

03:00.860 --> 03:01.940
I have to stay here to cleanse the evil spirit.

03:03.780 --> 03:04.500
Luo Ge!

03:39.900 --> 03:40.980
The poison is finally gone.

03:41.980 --> 03:43.220
But if Liu Shao wakes up,

03:43.700 --> 03:45.540
I'm sure she'll ask to save Luo Ge.

03:46.260 --> 03:47.340
I'm injured now.

03:47.900 --> 03:48.900
I can't help them.

03:50.100 --> 03:50.660
Brother.

04:00.740 --> 04:01.620
You're injured again?

04:03.180 --> 04:04.580
What's so good about that Liu Shao?

04:05.140 --> 04:06.090
She's gotten you into trouble again and again.

04:07.770 --> 04:08.340
Luo Ning came here.

04:11.860 --> 04:12.620
Mr. Tai told you?

04:13.260 --> 04:14.860
I can't let her see you come back.

04:15.220 --> 04:15.860
If she knows

04:15.860 --> 04:17.010
Luo Ge is still in Yin-yang Cave,

04:17.260 --> 04:18.459
I'm afraid she'll make it a big deal.

04:19.459 --> 04:20.620
She's Luo Ge's sister.

04:21.420 --> 04:22.220
There are some things

04:22.860 --> 04:23.820
she should know.

04:26.940 --> 04:28.740
If Luo Ge dies today,

04:31.740 --> 04:33.060
it can only be good for us.

04:37.810 --> 04:38.540
Fu.

04:39.540 --> 04:41.980
The Three Realms are inextricably linked.

04:42.460 --> 04:43.540
If something happens to Luo Ge,

04:43.900 --> 04:45.460
it can't be good for the demon world.

04:46.540 --> 04:47.620
Even if it's for Luo Ning's sake,

04:47.940 --> 04:49.180
you shouldn't let her down.

04:52.930 --> 04:53.940
Why not?

04:55.220 --> 04:56.580
Luo Ge is the stumbling block

04:56.580 --> 04:58.610
for us to break free.

04:59.650 --> 05:00.540
You're always like this.

05:01.180 --> 05:02.700
I'm afraid you'll regret it one day.

05:07.820 --> 05:08.460
I see.

05:13.300 --> 05:14.740
This is the medicine I had Mr. Tai recently make.

05:15.060 --> 05:16.250
It should be good for your hand.

05:34.620 --> 05:35.300
Immortal.

05:36.500 --> 05:37.690
Your immortal energy is already damaged.

05:38.260 --> 05:39.770
You don't have to stay for us.

05:42.260 --> 05:43.340
We're all disciples of the Immortal Palace.

05:44.420 --> 05:45.700
I won't give up on you.

05:46.540 --> 05:48.580
And the evil spirit in the cave can affect the Four Seasons Monument at any time.

05:49.250 --> 05:50.740
Only by setting up a formation with my immortal energy

05:51.420 --> 05:52.460
can I purify the resentment of the fellow disciples

05:52.780 --> 05:54.180
at once.

05:54.780 --> 05:56.100
It's also my wish.

05:57.260 --> 05:58.820
I'm willing to do my small part.

06:00.500 --> 06:01.780
I've already found her.

06:03.100 --> 06:04.020
My wish has been fulfilled.

06:05.140 --> 06:06.180
I don't

06:07.060 --> 06:08.140
ask for your protection.

06:08.860 --> 06:10.020
If you need me,

06:10.250 --> 06:11.300
I would kill or die for you.

06:12.860 --> 06:14.100
What are you talking about?

06:14.940 --> 06:16.540
You're a righteous man

06:16.740 --> 06:17.810
of honor.

06:18.260 --> 06:19.580
The Immortal will protect you.

06:20.460 --> 06:21.340
I'm ashamed to say

06:21.660 --> 06:22.740
that I...

06:23.290 --> 06:24.500
Since you want to help,

06:25.420 --> 06:26.460
why don't we split up

06:28.060 --> 06:29.900
and set up the formation with my immortal energy?

06:31.140 --> 06:31.860
Xie Lingqi.

06:32.530 --> 06:33.770
You've been guarding the Three Realms for a thousand years.

06:34.210 --> 06:35.140
It's a blessing for the Immortal Palace.

06:35.740 --> 06:37.020
You have to do a lot more

06:37.659 --> 06:38.340
for the Immortal Palace in the future.

06:41.300 --> 06:43.250
I will complete whatever I'm entrusted with.

06:50.860 --> 06:51.460
Luo Ge.

06:55.420 --> 06:55.820
Liu Shao.

06:56.140 --> 06:56.659
He Na.

06:56.860 --> 06:57.580
Where is Luo Ge?

07:00.820 --> 07:01.900
He stayed in the cave.

07:02.500 --> 07:03.700
He said he had to purify the evil spirit

07:04.940 --> 07:05.900
and let us out first.

07:07.810 --> 07:09.700
I've unblocked

07:09.860 --> 07:10.660
the restraint Bai Feng placed on the Wang Bell.

07:25.340 --> 07:26.180
Luo Ge.

07:27.940 --> 07:29.220
Luo Ge, are you okay?

07:31.860 --> 07:32.460
I'm fine.

07:36.900 --> 07:38.300
Why didn't you come out?

07:38.700 --> 07:39.540
You don't have to worry.

07:40.260 --> 07:41.260
I'm staying here

07:41.860 --> 07:42.490
to resolve

07:42.490 --> 07:43.970
the resentment of the disciples of the Immortal Palace.

07:45.300 --> 07:46.020
You should rest well.

07:46.340 --> 07:47.220
Don't worry about me.

07:52.370 --> 07:54.420
Is it because you're affected by our incompatible spiritual power?

07:56.100 --> 07:56.860
Anyway,

07:57.780 --> 07:58.820
no matter what,

08:00.060 --> 08:01.060
you'll come out.

08:01.220 --> 08:02.650
You will definitely come out, right?

08:04.330 --> 08:05.220
What if

08:05.900 --> 08:07.290
I can't get out

08:08.130 --> 08:09.140
and I'm trapped here?

08:11.580 --> 08:12.620
Will you wait for me?

08:15.460 --> 08:16.820
If you can't get out,

08:17.740 --> 08:19.820
I'll get married to another guy.

08:20.020 --> 08:20.860
How dare you?

08:23.020 --> 08:24.300
So consider it for my sake,

08:24.300 --> 08:25.940
come out, please.

08:36.900 --> 08:37.419
Okay.

08:38.460 --> 08:39.380
I will.

09:11.020 --> 09:11.700
You're leaving?

09:13.660 --> 09:14.900
If you're going to Yin-yang Cave,

09:15.540 --> 09:16.660
can you wait for me for a couple of days?

09:17.180 --> 09:18.090
I'll go with you

09:18.180 --> 09:18.900
after a short rest.

09:19.380 --> 09:20.500
Although you won't tell me,

09:20.740 --> 09:22.180
I know you're badly hurt.

09:22.860 --> 09:24.300
Just stay here and recuperate.

09:25.740 --> 09:26.220
But you…

09:27.100 --> 09:27.820
Don't worry.

09:28.340 --> 09:29.650
I won't act impulsively.

09:31.300 --> 09:32.140
I will go back to the Immortal Palace

09:32.140 --> 09:33.380
and ask the seniors for help.

09:34.220 --> 09:34.740
That's good.

09:35.100 --> 09:36.170
The one who sealed the cave

09:36.420 --> 09:37.340
was Shang Yurong's father,

09:37.460 --> 09:38.180
Lord Shang.

09:38.660 --> 09:39.530
Go to Shang Yurong.

09:39.980 --> 09:41.180
He will help you.

09:43.260 --> 09:43.780
Okay.

09:45.260 --> 09:46.020
No matter what,

09:46.860 --> 09:48.540
I will get Luo Ge out of there.

09:50.100 --> 09:50.580
You will.

10:13.260 --> 10:14.980
Master Shang, Immortal Master.

10:18.500 --> 10:19.060
Liu Shao.

10:20.620 --> 10:21.740
Do you recognize your fault?

10:24.220 --> 10:25.380
I don't understand.

10:26.660 --> 10:28.890
You promised not to see Luo Ge again.

10:29.260 --> 10:30.300
Not only did you break your promise,

10:30.380 --> 10:32.340
you even got Luo Ge into the Ying-yang Cave.

10:32.890 --> 10:33.980
Now that you're out,

10:35.020 --> 10:36.260
why hasn't he come out yet?

10:38.260 --> 10:39.060
He...

10:42.020 --> 10:43.060
He...

10:46.130 --> 10:47.660
Luo Ge just sent me a message,

10:48.100 --> 10:49.980
saying he had to

10:50.260 --> 10:51.180
purify the evil spirit in the Ying-yang Cave.

10:51.540 --> 10:52.460
He can take it as a cultivation

10:52.650 --> 10:53.660
which can also

10:53.860 --> 10:54.740
stabilizes the Four Seasons Monument.

10:55.060 --> 10:55.620
Nonsense.

10:56.140 --> 10:57.500
If no one had broken into the cave,

10:57.690 --> 10:59.020
there would not be any evil spirit turmoil.

10:59.660 --> 11:01.450
If Luo Ge's cultivation is damaged again this time,

11:01.580 --> 11:05.250
can you afford the responsibility, Liu Shao?

11:18.100 --> 11:19.620
Let's go to the Ying-yang Cave.

11:19.900 --> 11:21.140
We have to get Luo Ge out as soon as possible.

11:26.300 --> 11:27.980
The Tian Kui Formation I asked you to set up

11:28.700 --> 11:30.340
can eliminate all the evil spirit

11:30.340 --> 11:31.340
within the area covered by the formation.

11:34.380 --> 11:35.620
After the center is set up,

11:36.580 --> 11:37.380
Tian Kui Formation

11:38.100 --> 11:39.940
will activate itself in one hour.

11:41.060 --> 11:41.980
It's finally done.

11:42.380 --> 11:42.860
Shiwei.

11:43.300 --> 11:44.900
See if there's an antidote on these people.

12:06.220 --> 12:06.980
I found it.

12:08.020 --> 12:08.740
Lingqi.

12:09.780 --> 12:10.460
I found it.

12:10.860 --> 12:11.380
Shiwei.

12:12.300 --> 12:13.780
This is the fourth bottle we found.

12:14.300 --> 12:15.300
You're good.

12:16.140 --> 12:17.140
Let's go meet up with Luo Ge.

12:17.500 --> 12:17.780
Let's go.

12:17.860 --> 12:18.220
Okay.

12:23.820 --> 12:24.340
Let's go.

12:27.460 --> 12:28.180
What's wrong with you?

12:29.620 --> 12:30.100
Let's go.

12:31.180 --> 12:32.060
Don't scare me.

12:48.900 --> 12:49.660
Wake up.

12:49.980 --> 12:50.780
I'm Lingqi.

12:51.540 --> 12:52.500
I'm Lingqi.

13:09.010 --> 13:09.740
I just...

13:10.460 --> 13:10.940
Shiwei.

13:11.900 --> 13:13.300
Your will is stronger than others.

13:13.780 --> 13:15.260
And you've practiced mind-clearing cultivation.

13:15.820 --> 13:17.020
That's why you've been able to

13:17.500 --> 13:18.500
barely keep sober.

13:20.580 --> 13:21.100
But...

13:22.060 --> 13:23.860
But I've been here for a thousand years.

13:24.820 --> 13:27.020
The Moon Poison has already penetrated my bones.

13:27.660 --> 13:28.500
It can't be eradicated.

13:29.460 --> 13:31.180
I could lose my mind at any time,

13:31.690 --> 13:33.340
or even harm those around me.

13:35.100 --> 13:35.660
Right?

13:38.420 --> 13:40.300
You can collect more Sun Spring.

13:40.900 --> 13:41.900
You only need a small amount to recover

13:42.220 --> 13:43.860
with your physical state.

13:47.300 --> 13:48.140
I'm not afraid.

13:49.330 --> 13:50.500
I'm happy

13:50.700 --> 13:51.980
to see you again.

13:52.980 --> 13:54.380
Even if I have to go back…

13:55.060 --> 13:55.740
Don't say that.

13:56.260 --> 13:57.300
Immortal Luo Ge is here.

13:57.820 --> 13:58.780
We will be fine.

13:59.460 --> 13:59.980
It's okay.

14:02.180 --> 14:02.660
I won't leave you here alone again

14:03.540 --> 14:05.020
this time.

14:13.500 --> 14:14.060
Liu Shao.

14:14.980 --> 14:15.610
Why are you here?

14:16.380 --> 14:17.620
I know your immortal energy is damaged.

14:18.020 --> 14:19.340
I brought an expert to help you.

14:20.260 --> 14:20.860
An expert?

14:27.980 --> 14:28.580
Luo Ge.

14:31.140 --> 14:32.580
You should be recuperating at Place Chonghua.

14:32.980 --> 14:33.820
Why are you back?

14:34.260 --> 14:35.380
And with an expert?

14:36.700 --> 14:37.220
Luo Ge.

14:37.450 --> 14:38.090
Could you expect

14:38.500 --> 14:40.140
that you need me to save you one day?

14:41.340 --> 14:42.020
Shang Yurong.

14:42.500 --> 14:43.700
I'm afraid your Burning Sea

14:44.100 --> 14:44.860
is not enough.

14:45.820 --> 14:47.420
We still got a fairy here, right?

14:48.020 --> 14:48.420
Liu Shao.

14:48.620 --> 14:49.340
Stand back.

15:19.860 --> 15:20.860
Burning Sea?

15:21.100 --> 15:22.580
I thought he didn't acquire it after hundreds of years of practice.

15:22.940 --> 15:24.530
Shang Yurong acquired it

15:25.100 --> 15:26.020
500 years ago.

15:34.420 --> 15:34.980
Watch out.

15:36.660 --> 15:37.500
They're coming after us.

15:41.740 --> 15:42.700
They've been trapped here for a thousand years.

15:42.900 --> 15:44.380
It's their obsession to get out.

15:44.740 --> 15:45.940
As long as there's a loophole in the boundary,

15:46.100 --> 15:47.740
they will do whatever it takes to escape.

15:49.220 --> 15:49.660
Immortal.

15:49.940 --> 15:50.570
You're wounded.

15:50.860 --> 15:51.460
Let us do it.

16:12.620 --> 16:13.060
Liu Shao.

16:13.180 --> 16:14.140
Attack the rift.

16:20.420 --> 16:21.740
Even the Lightning Slash can't break it.

16:26.140 --> 16:26.540
Liu Shao.

16:26.660 --> 16:28.100
Do you have any other moves?

16:29.340 --> 16:30.100
If you do,

16:30.100 --> 16:31.060
use it.

16:31.060 --> 16:32.060
Help me.

17:28.140 --> 17:28.900
Liu Shao.

17:29.580 --> 17:31.940
Inject Qi into your body and help the yin with the yang.

17:32.580 --> 17:35.010
Bodhi palms together, hand-knotted with a flower.

17:35.740 --> 17:38.220
Hide the hollowness of Taixu, and make your mind fall into the sea of Qi.

17:38.700 --> 17:42.260
The heart moves with the hands and the music of heaven comes out.

17:55.220 --> 17:57.460
This is the power of the Sun.

18:00.060 --> 18:00.580
Luo Ge.

18:00.660 --> 18:01.260
Come out.

18:01.340 --> 18:02.460
Help me maintain the boundary crack.

18:11.700 --> 18:13.820
Xie Lingqi, come out!

18:17.220 --> 18:17.740
Shiwei.

18:17.740 --> 18:18.220
Go!

18:22.380 --> 18:23.220
Come back!

18:23.460 --> 18:24.540
I can't hold on anymore.

18:51.860 --> 18:52.540
Hurry up.

18:53.660 --> 18:54.340
Hurry up.

18:54.620 --> 18:55.340
Come on.

19:09.180 --> 19:10.500
Shiwei.

19:34.900 --> 19:36.140
Shiwei!

19:36.780 --> 19:37.620
Lingqi.

19:39.980 --> 19:42.060
You don't have to wait for me this time.

19:48.300 --> 19:48.860
Shiwei.

19:50.260 --> 19:50.900
Shiwei.

20:11.840 --> 20:16.390
♫The begonia is red, but every promise makes it more withered♫

20:18.500 --> 20:23.240
♫It blooms alone, but the wind and rain are more violent♫

20:23.020 --> 20:24.700
Don't worry about me, you go first, it's too late.

20:23.760 --> 20:29.810
♫Plants are not human beings, and ruthless fruits are planted♫

20:24.700 --> 20:25.810
I won't leave you here.

20:25.810 --> 20:27.380
-Let's go together. -Just go.

20:30.810 --> 20:36.800
♫How can you forget the innocence and ignorance when we first met?♫

20:33.700 --> 20:34.300
Shiwei.

20:38.260 --> 20:43.100
♫The butterfly emerges from the chrysalis, but it is difficult to fly to the sky♫

20:38.900 --> 20:39.660
Immortal.

20:40.090 --> 20:41.060
I beg you.

20:41.980 --> 20:43.590
Shiwei is still inside.

20:44.670 --> 20:49.780
♫The butterfly's wings were broken, and the dream fell without a trace♫

20:44.700 --> 20:46.260
Help me get her out, please.

20:48.090 --> 20:49.340
I just found her.

20:49.900 --> 20:51.540
Help me get her out!

20:50.080 --> 20:56.140
♫Because of their greed for the warmth of fire, they lost each other♫

20:52.930 --> 20:54.100
She's not dead yet.

20:54.460 --> 20:55.660
She's still inside.

20:56.540 --> 20:58.380
Help me get her out.

20:56.550 --> 21:03.290
♫There is a period of youth, and he is waiting for the spring breeze in the coming year♫

20:59.060 --> 21:02.300
She's still in there.

21:06.560 --> 21:09.610
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

21:09.780 --> 21:12.560
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

21:09.860 --> 21:11.820
She's still in there.

21:12.660 --> 21:13.340
I beg you.

21:13.160 --> 21:15.700
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

21:14.140 --> 21:14.900
I beg you.

21:15.380 --> 21:15.980
I beg you.

21:15.700 --> 21:19.290
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

21:17.900 --> 21:18.660
I beg you.

21:19.340 --> 21:20.900
I beg you.

21:19.650 --> 21:22.240
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

21:22.240 --> 21:26.670
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

21:26.670 --> 21:32.890
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

21:26.860 --> 21:29.260
She's still in there.

21:29.740 --> 21:30.980
She's still in there.

21:32.890 --> 21:36.180
♫I'm willing to spread my wings♫

21:36.180 --> 21:39.310
♫And don't fight the fate♫

21:38.220 --> 21:39.220
I'm sorry.

21:39.310 --> 21:49.070
♫It's a good moment to share the world with you♫

21:40.860 --> 21:41.860
I can't save her.

21:54.540 --> 21:55.540
But Shiwei

21:57.300 --> 21:58.620
saved all the fellow disciples.

22:18.790 --> 22:21.320
♫How many times do we have to reincarnate♫

22:22.120 --> 22:25.230
♫Before we meet again in the next life?♫

22:25.450 --> 22:28.000
♫Suffer all grief and long hate♫

22:28.000 --> 22:32.410
♫Reversed right and wrong dreams♫

22:29.260 --> 22:30.820
Shiwei.

22:32.180 --> 22:35.340
Shiwei.

22:32.410 --> 22:35.760
♫I exiled my thousand-year-old body♫

22:35.780 --> 22:39.190
♫Waiting for the ashes to slowly burn in the heart♫

22:39.190 --> 22:45.950
♫Wait until the end of life to see the begonia turn red again♫

23:09.020 --> 23:09.980
I'll go plead for General Xie

23:10.460 --> 23:11.500
in front of senior.

23:11.900 --> 23:13.580
I hope she'll lighten his punishment.

23:14.540 --> 23:15.060
Okay.

23:27.700 --> 23:28.410
Xie Lingqi.

23:29.450 --> 23:30.380
If you don't mind,

23:31.260 --> 23:32.660
you can stay at Palace Chonghua first.

23:32.940 --> 23:34.020
I will explain everything

23:34.620 --> 23:35.780
to Master Zhuo.

23:36.420 --> 23:37.100
That's not necessary.

23:40.340 --> 23:41.300
In Shiwei's mind,

23:42.740 --> 23:44.140
I'm a righteous

23:44.540 --> 23:46.050
and responsible man.

23:46.780 --> 23:47.930
I can't let her down.

23:48.860 --> 23:50.820
I will return to the Bone Melting Pool from today.

23:51.580 --> 23:53.060
I will be punished

23:54.980 --> 23:55.700
as I should be

23:57.170 --> 23:58.900
for the wrong I have done.

24:02.180 --> 24:03.020
This is the Sun Spring

24:03.020 --> 24:04.970
I've collected with Shiwei these days.

24:06.020 --> 24:06.820
Now she

24:07.690 --> 24:08.420
won't use it anymore.

24:09.300 --> 24:10.620
So take it

24:10.620 --> 24:11.820
as our token of appreciation.

24:13.980 --> 24:15.700
You can use it for your health.

24:16.220 --> 24:17.340
Take it as the least contribution

24:17.940 --> 24:19.100
Shiwei did

24:19.860 --> 24:21.180
for all beings in the Three Realms.

24:35.540 --> 24:36.380
Thank you, General Yu.

24:38.460 --> 24:39.210
My condolences.

25:06.260 --> 25:06.930
Luo Ge.

25:07.370 --> 25:08.540
If I were trapped for a thousand years,

25:08.780 --> 25:09.300
would you

25:09.300 --> 25:10.540
never give up looking for me

25:12.460 --> 25:14.700
like Xie Lingqi did?

25:15.460 --> 25:16.380
I can't bear

25:17.060 --> 25:18.140
to let you be trapped for a thousand years either.

25:20.700 --> 25:22.780
The pain of a thousand years of departure is unbearable.

25:24.140 --> 25:25.380
So I want to find

25:25.540 --> 25:27.860
the way to eliminate the conflict of spiritual powers.

25:28.340 --> 25:29.940
But the fragments of Sun Spirit

25:30.540 --> 25:31.780
have been fused with you.

25:32.300 --> 25:34.890
I will find another way for you.

25:39.220 --> 25:40.820
I have to seal the spirit energy as soon as possible.

25:41.580 --> 25:43.260
I can't let Luo Ge get hurt for me again.

25:45.780 --> 25:47.180
Luo Ge is out?

25:47.180 --> 25:47.940
Yes.

25:48.060 --> 25:49.860
Shang Yurong, Master of the Three Palaces,

25:49.860 --> 25:51.300
saved Luo Ge from death

25:52.220 --> 25:53.740
with the Burning Sea.

25:56.220 --> 25:58.580
I never thought he would be so lucky.

25:59.380 --> 26:00.740
The Immortal is safe and sound.

26:01.500 --> 26:02.860
You can return to the Immortal Palace at any time

26:03.700 --> 26:04.420
to reunite with him.

26:08.290 --> 26:09.180
Your injury...

26:10.260 --> 26:10.980
It's just a minor injury.

26:11.540 --> 26:12.260
It's nothing to worry about.

26:13.700 --> 26:15.140
If you're not treated in time,

26:15.740 --> 26:16.340
will it

26:17.180 --> 26:18.380
be dangerous?

26:20.380 --> 26:21.620
You don't have to bother, Fairy Luo Ning.

26:29.900 --> 26:30.900
Bone-corroding Harp?

26:40.580 --> 26:41.140
Fairy.

26:41.940 --> 26:42.940
If you are willing to help me,

26:43.740 --> 26:45.380
can you lift the curse of Aquatic Demons?

26:47.300 --> 26:47.900
I...

26:48.300 --> 26:49.900
Can I do it?

26:53.220 --> 26:54.380
Legend has it that Immortal Ze Shui

26:54.930 --> 26:55.700
can lift the curse

26:55.820 --> 26:56.860
with the Bone-corroding Harp.

26:57.300 --> 26:59.340
You should be the successor of Immortal Ze Shui's immortal energy.

26:59.940 --> 27:01.020
If you are willing to do so,

27:01.540 --> 27:02.740
I'd like you to give it a try.

27:05.500 --> 27:06.020
Okay.

27:35.620 --> 27:36.820
Bone-corroding Harp.

27:38.980 --> 27:39.580
Luo Ning.

28:03.620 --> 28:04.220
Demon King.

28:04.940 --> 28:05.980
I'm afraid

28:06.420 --> 28:07.740
I can't lift the curse.

28:08.340 --> 28:09.860
As I thought about lifting the curse,

28:10.420 --> 28:12.220
my hands got powerless.

28:13.090 --> 28:14.260
Maybe it's because

28:15.140 --> 28:16.020
someone doesn't think

28:17.220 --> 28:18.380
I'm qualified.

28:20.220 --> 28:21.860
Even the inheritor of Immortal Ze Shui

28:22.580 --> 28:23.660
can't break the curse?

28:31.340 --> 28:32.180
Tell me.

28:32.460 --> 28:34.460
I'm coming back like nothing happened.

28:35.140 --> 28:36.300
What should I say

28:37.420 --> 28:38.660
to the Immortal Master?

28:39.420 --> 28:40.260
No need to explain.

28:40.540 --> 28:41.300
I have something to discuss with you.

28:41.300 --> 28:42.620
Liu Shao, you're finally back.

28:44.100 --> 28:45.220
Is it cold in the house?

28:48.460 --> 28:49.380
I'll go back first.

29:00.170 --> 29:00.740
Liu Shao.

29:01.540 --> 29:02.300
What's wrong with you?

29:02.580 --> 29:03.220
Are you okay?

29:07.220 --> 29:07.930
Master.

29:08.500 --> 29:09.940
I want to seal the divine spirit.

29:10.220 --> 29:11.700
I need your help to do so.

29:39.980 --> 29:40.460
Luo Ning.

29:41.220 --> 29:43.220
Your brother has left the Ying-yang Cave

29:43.220 --> 29:44.100
and is back at the Immortal Palace.

29:45.100 --> 29:45.740
I know.

29:46.260 --> 29:47.940
Your brother has just told me.

29:48.380 --> 29:49.130
My brother?

29:52.180 --> 29:52.490
Yes.

29:53.180 --> 29:54.660
He cares about your brother.

29:55.850 --> 29:56.860
Why are you here again?

29:57.460 --> 29:58.460
I was thinking about

29:58.620 --> 30:00.890
the curse of your clan.

30:01.340 --> 30:02.340
Since it's caused by

30:02.460 --> 30:04.540
the Demon King and Immortal Ze Shui,

30:05.380 --> 30:06.140
I think

30:06.500 --> 30:07.340
the Brahma Tree

30:07.380 --> 30:08.780
should know something.

30:09.740 --> 30:10.540
But

30:10.770 --> 30:12.620
I can feel the presence of the tree spirit.

30:12.940 --> 30:14.020
I can also feel

30:14.100 --> 30:15.340
it's very friendly to me.

30:16.940 --> 30:18.940
But it just won't say anything to me.

30:25.450 --> 30:26.580
Anyway, the curse

30:27.020 --> 30:28.340
has been trapping us for 10,000 years.

30:28.540 --> 30:29.700
No matter what,

30:29.820 --> 30:30.500
I will

30:30.700 --> 30:31.620
get rid of it.

30:32.100 --> 30:33.740
Don't take the wrong path.

30:38.290 --> 30:39.660
I'll listen to you.

30:39.740 --> 30:40.810
I won't take the wrong path.

30:40.900 --> 30:41.460
Okay?

30:43.140 --> 30:45.010
You're just saying that.

30:45.340 --> 30:47.420
But you don't think that way at all.

30:47.460 --> 30:48.190
Am I right?

30:48.500 --> 30:49.410
That's not true.

30:50.380 --> 30:51.260
You're watching over me,

30:51.860 --> 30:52.540
aren't you?

30:52.860 --> 30:53.740
Does it help?

30:54.020 --> 30:55.380
Even if I'm watching you,

30:55.780 --> 30:56.700
will you listen to me?

30:56.900 --> 30:58.700
Can I clear your bad thoughts?

30:59.540 --> 30:59.980
All right.

31:00.660 --> 31:01.610
I'm going back to the Immortal Palace.

31:02.700 --> 31:03.690
Why do you have to go back again?

31:06.020 --> 31:07.140
I think your brother

31:07.180 --> 31:08.860
is also worried about this every day.

31:09.260 --> 31:10.260
Since this is caused by

31:10.300 --> 31:11.940
Immortal Ze Shui,

31:13.060 --> 31:14.850
I, as the inheritor of her immortal energy,

31:15.220 --> 31:17.020
should have a chance to solve this.

31:17.570 --> 31:18.410
I'm thinking about

31:18.820 --> 31:19.940
asking my brother

31:20.180 --> 31:21.100
and those

31:21.220 --> 31:23.250
elders in the Immortal Palace.

31:23.580 --> 31:24.930
Maybe there will be some clues.

31:29.060 --> 31:30.220
It's about the Aquatic Demons.

31:30.500 --> 31:31.940
What's the point of asking a bunch of old men

31:31.940 --> 31:32.940
in the Immortal Palace?

31:34.260 --> 31:35.820
I'll take care of the demon realm.

31:36.220 --> 31:38.140
Why don't you

31:38.140 --> 31:38.740
just be a happy little fairy?

31:39.980 --> 31:40.820
No.

31:41.300 --> 31:43.260
Who knows what other crazy things you'll do

31:43.540 --> 31:45.580
to lift the curse?

31:46.340 --> 31:47.460
Okay, that's it.

31:47.580 --> 31:48.620
I'm really going back.

31:50.540 --> 31:51.100
I forbid you to go.

31:52.100 --> 31:53.290
Who knows

31:53.420 --> 31:54.500
when you'll be back?

31:55.100 --> 31:55.940
You forbid me?

31:56.580 --> 31:57.860
How?

31:58.130 --> 31:59.060
You're locking me up

31:59.380 --> 32:00.260
and won't let me go out?

32:01.300 --> 32:01.940
No.

32:02.500 --> 32:03.220
Fu.

32:03.740 --> 32:04.420
Remember.

32:05.180 --> 32:06.620
You're not the Demon King from 10,000 years ago.

32:06.860 --> 32:08.180
I'm not Immortal Ze Shui either.

32:08.700 --> 32:09.300
So

32:09.580 --> 32:11.180
don't always think of imitating the Demon King,

32:11.370 --> 32:12.060
understand?

32:13.980 --> 32:14.620
Yes, I understand.

32:17.060 --> 32:18.860
Whether you find the way or not,

32:19.330 --> 32:20.460
you have to promise me one thing.

32:21.620 --> 32:23.260
Don't come back too late to see me.

32:24.220 --> 32:24.780
Three days.

32:25.580 --> 32:26.020
Five days.

32:27.020 --> 32:27.740
Seven days.

32:29.460 --> 32:30.300
It depends on my mood.

32:31.740 --> 32:33.060
At least give me a message.

32:33.580 --> 32:34.660
Half a month at most.

32:35.260 --> 32:36.260
Don't leave me for a long time.

32:39.730 --> 32:40.980
What little fairy?

32:41.580 --> 32:42.980
She's a little witch.

32:45.540 --> 32:47.020
She comes and goes

32:47.020 --> 32:48.100
whenever she likes.

32:48.900 --> 32:50.260
What does she take me for?

32:53.500 --> 32:55.340
What a princess!

33:02.540 --> 33:03.140
Mother of Trees.

33:03.780 --> 33:05.180
You're treating me like this too.

33:05.460 --> 33:07.020
I can chop you up and burn you as firewood.

33:12.700 --> 33:13.220
The Mother of Trees

33:13.580 --> 33:14.380
is also a princess

33:14.580 --> 33:15.380
like Luo Ning.

33:17.740 --> 33:18.460
Now she's gone.

33:19.300 --> 33:20.660
I wonder how long it will take for her to return.

33:21.330 --> 33:22.580
No way.

33:23.380 --> 33:24.380
I must marry her.

33:25.980 --> 33:26.780
When she comes next time,

33:27.300 --> 33:28.460
I'll make her happy first

33:29.020 --> 33:30.660
and then talk to my brother about it.

33:31.780 --> 33:32.380
That's it.

33:34.940 --> 33:36.740
So you asked us to come here

33:37.180 --> 33:38.100
to nourish

33:38.260 --> 33:39.900
Liu Shao's body?

33:40.180 --> 33:40.820
Yes.

33:42.140 --> 33:43.740
She only has one talisman pearl left in her body.

33:44.660 --> 33:46.060
And all that she's been through

33:48.060 --> 33:49.690
has affected her cultivation.

33:51.140 --> 33:51.980
So

33:53.020 --> 33:54.180
I want your help.

33:54.860 --> 33:56.580
Maybe you can see something that I can't.

33:58.300 --> 33:59.340
Even if it's just

34:00.980 --> 34:02.260
a little clue.

34:04.220 --> 34:06.090
You're being overly greedy.

34:06.460 --> 34:07.900
Her spiritual power has been damaged.

34:08.610 --> 34:10.139
It's difficult to cultivate again.

34:10.820 --> 34:12.540
Do you want to spoil it?

34:13.540 --> 34:14.020
But

34:14.540 --> 34:15.820
if you stew him,

34:16.460 --> 34:18.780
Liu Shao's cultivation level can rise by at least one or two steps.

34:19.699 --> 34:22.060
Think twice about it, Immortal.

34:22.980 --> 34:24.780
Don't look at me like that.

34:26.780 --> 34:27.420
Master.

34:27.820 --> 34:29.060
You've lived for 10,000 years.

34:29.219 --> 34:30.580
That's about right.

34:30.580 --> 34:31.929
Immortal.

34:34.179 --> 34:34.699
Master.

34:36.699 --> 34:37.940
I remember how good you are to Liu Shao.

34:41.699 --> 34:42.500
Immortal.

34:43.340 --> 34:44.780
Remember to burn some ghost money for me

34:45.460 --> 34:46.820
on festivals.

34:47.580 --> 34:48.929
Gold dollars would do too.

34:52.730 --> 34:54.139
Prepare the medicine on the list.

34:55.020 --> 34:56.420
Maybe you won't need the ghost money.

35:07.180 --> 35:08.580
You might as well stew me up.

35:10.300 --> 35:12.540
The Immortal Master scolded Master Shang.

35:13.140 --> 35:15.900
Immortal Luo broke into the Ying-yang Cave.

35:16.820 --> 35:18.220
My “Anecdote of the Xiyin Mountain”

35:18.220 --> 35:19.340
is further enriched.

35:22.100 --> 35:22.780
Liu Shao.

35:23.020 --> 35:24.700
You're still thinking about sealing the divine energy?

35:26.020 --> 35:27.610
I already have the Tears of the Half-Demon.

35:28.700 --> 35:30.340
What I don't have now is

35:30.620 --> 35:33.420
the assistance of three immortals whose cultivation is above the general.

35:34.540 --> 35:35.940
Shang Yurong is easy to deal with.

35:36.940 --> 35:39.100
But I don't know

35:39.370 --> 35:41.300
how to convince Master Zhuo.

35:44.260 --> 35:45.340
It's simple.

35:45.580 --> 35:47.130
Why don't you let Shang Yurong do it for you?

35:47.780 --> 35:50.140
Zhuo Qiuqin has been very nice to Shang Yurong these days.

35:51.540 --> 35:52.380
You won't

35:52.820 --> 35:54.090
really seal the divine energy

35:54.380 --> 35:55.860
for the Immortal, will you?

35:56.420 --> 35:57.850
It will only make him worry

35:57.850 --> 36:00.060
if I tell him I plan to do it.

36:00.580 --> 36:02.060
Forget it.

36:04.900 --> 36:05.380
Master.

36:05.580 --> 36:06.460
The Immortal asks to see you.

36:07.660 --> 36:08.500
You are

36:08.540 --> 36:09.780
always tormenting me.

36:12.940 --> 36:14.260
What medicines are still missing?

36:15.060 --> 36:16.420
What are you rushing for?

36:17.220 --> 36:17.900
I've never even seen

36:18.020 --> 36:19.580
some of them before.

36:22.060 --> 36:24.580
Baffling Star Stone.

36:25.370 --> 36:27.660
Clear Vine.

36:30.540 --> 36:31.100
See?

36:31.300 --> 36:32.500
Where can I find it for you?

36:36.460 --> 36:37.460
Immortal Luo Ge.

36:37.780 --> 36:39.450
These herbs are not just for health.

36:40.180 --> 36:41.260
They can also enhance

36:41.500 --> 36:43.020
Liu Shao's Sun Spirit.

36:43.860 --> 36:45.260
Aren't you afraid

36:46.170 --> 36:47.340
that it will make your spiritual power

36:47.340 --> 36:48.460
even more incompatible?

36:50.170 --> 36:51.580
Isn't the Clear Vine you mentioned

36:52.540 --> 36:53.820
in the Bone Melting Pool?

36:54.860 --> 36:55.210
Yes.

36:55.210 --> 36:57.380
But it takes the power of a God to find it.

37:01.020 --> 37:02.140
What about the Baffling Star Stone?

37:03.410 --> 37:04.620
That's even harder to find.

37:04.860 --> 37:06.740
That was the collection of the Demon King ten thousand years ago.

37:08.180 --> 37:09.060
Demon King?

37:10.770 --> 37:11.580
Immortal.

37:11.820 --> 37:12.820
The Demon King requests an audience.

37:25.300 --> 37:27.020
I thought you would meet me at Litian Temple

37:27.260 --> 37:28.340
or at Palace Chonghua.

37:30.860 --> 37:32.820
When Liu Shao and I were at our wit's end,

37:34.100 --> 37:35.460
it was you who stood in front of us,

37:36.260 --> 37:37.300
saying

37:38.500 --> 37:39.460
we were your friends.

37:40.980 --> 37:41.900
So you remembered.

37:45.210 --> 37:46.740
I remembered after I ascended to immortality.

37:47.580 --> 37:48.660
Lu Li's friend

37:50.380 --> 37:51.580
is also my friend.

37:53.580 --> 37:55.380
I hadn't mentioned it deliberately before.

37:56.540 --> 37:57.700
But it's not because I forgot.

37:58.660 --> 37:59.780
In fact,

38:00.500 --> 38:01.940
I've always considered you my best friend too.

38:05.740 --> 38:06.380
He Na.

38:06.780 --> 38:08.260
Since you said we are friends,

38:08.580 --> 38:09.580
there is no need to be polite.

38:10.540 --> 38:11.660
If you have anything to say, say it.

38:19.060 --> 38:21.500
[From the Demon King He Na]

38:24.300 --> 38:25.860
The immortals and demons are bound to each other.

38:26.380 --> 38:27.900
From now on, we will live in peace

38:28.380 --> 38:29.180
with no more conflicts.

38:31.300 --> 38:31.740
He Na.

38:34.100 --> 38:35.260
That's a good wish.

38:38.340 --> 38:39.650
Do you think it's improper?

38:41.740 --> 38:42.740
I think it's good too.

38:43.700 --> 38:45.530
And I hope that one day it will be so.

38:46.700 --> 38:48.300
But there is Xie Lingqi in the Immortal Palace.

38:48.620 --> 38:49.500
And so does the Demon Palace.

38:50.340 --> 38:51.740
Someone at the Demon Palace caused trouble?

38:53.180 --> 38:54.780
Xie Lingqi should be the only one who has

38:56.020 --> 38:57.500
the Moon Poison Liu Shao suffers from.

38:58.340 --> 39:00.380
From Xie Lingqi's hiding to Bai Feng's poisoning,

39:00.820 --> 39:01.940
I suspect

39:02.500 --> 39:03.500
someone passed it on.

39:09.140 --> 39:09.860
You mean Fu?

39:10.310 --> 39:11.460
You are the king of the demon realm.

39:12.540 --> 39:14.220
If Fu makes a mistake,

39:15.020 --> 39:16.300
how can you convince the people?

39:18.660 --> 39:19.860
I see you as a friend.

39:22.540 --> 39:24.820
But I can't give Fu a break

39:25.340 --> 39:26.300
because of you.

39:28.860 --> 39:30.260
I think you can understand that.

39:32.900 --> 39:33.780
I understand.

39:37.540 --> 39:38.820
There's one more thing I want to ask you.

39:40.540 --> 39:41.380
What is it?

39:42.380 --> 39:43.380
Just say it.

39:45.540 --> 39:46.700
In the cave,

39:49.180 --> 39:50.380
Liu Shao forced out

39:51.460 --> 39:52.900
the divine weapon of the Sun, the Crown Wheel.

39:54.420 --> 39:56.260
She should be able to inherit the power of the Sun soon.

39:59.380 --> 40:00.740
So I want to find some herbs

40:01.540 --> 40:02.820
to boost her divine energy.

40:04.380 --> 40:05.500
and help with her cultivation.

40:07.780 --> 40:09.420
Is there any medicine that is not available at the Immortal Palace?

40:11.820 --> 40:13.130
Baffling Star Stone.

40:42.860 --> 40:43.580
What's that?

40:43.820 --> 40:45.090
The Brahma Tree is glowing.

40:45.700 --> 40:46.300
It's...

40:47.260 --> 40:48.980
His Majesty's Demon King's power.

40:50.060 --> 40:51.020
Could it be that His Majesty

40:51.260 --> 40:52.540
is searching for something

40:52.900 --> 40:54.330
with his power as the Demon King?

40:54.900 --> 40:57.420
He's actually using the spiritual power of Demon King.
